ense_xml/227/, but the resulting PR, https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/pull/1963, didn’t look right; it was trying to merge a new file with a dubious filename directly into `main`. I’m not sure how to make the requested change to the license request.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1540116175/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1548919157","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1939#issuecomment-1548919157","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1939","id":1548919157,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85cUqF1","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-05-16T03:20:37Z","updated_at":"2023-05-16T03:20:37Z","body":"+1 to add, will also add official license acceptance comment next. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions